{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24231","headline":"奉酬侍中夏中雨後游城南庄见示八韵 · 白居易","name":"奉酬侍中夏中雨後游城南庄见示八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岛树间林峦，云收雨气残。\n四山岚色重，五月水声寒。\n老鹤两三只，新篁千万竿。\n化成天竺寺，移得子陵滩。\n心觉闲弥贵，身缘健更欢。\n帝将风后待，人作谢公看。\n甪里年虽老，高阳兴未阑。\n佳辰不见召，争免趂杯盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}